# csrf-audit Rule

When auditing CSRF:
1. Follow `.agents/skills/csrf-audit/references/csrf_checklist.md` (XSRF-001 to XSRF-020, XSRF-B-*). PoCs: `references/csrf_poc_templates.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/csrf-audit/SKILL.md`. Track progress with `references/csrf_tracker.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first. Use `.agents/skills/csrf-audit/scripts/csrf_probe.py` on a harmless own-account request and `scripts/csrf_token_analyze.py` offline on collected tokens.
4. Victim is always your own second account in a separate browser profile. Never send PoCs to real users.
